00:39:45.980 --> 00:39:46.500
Keep me company.

00:39:48.330 --> 00:39:49.250
I need milk, too.

00:39:49.740 --> 00:39:55.400
And the beer is right next to it in the case.

00:39:55.560 --> 00:39:57.220
It's right there.

00:39:59.440 --> 00:39:59.740
Okay.

00:40:04.920 --> 00:40:11.650
You can do this.

00:40:29.330 --> 00:40:29.810
Call him.

00:40:30.960 --> 00:40:32.100
Maybe he wants to apologize.

00:40:33.480 --> 00:40:34.040
For what?

00:40:34.960 --> 00:40:36.480
Being the same way he always is to me?

00:40:38.300 --> 00:40:39.380
Can't blame the Major for that.

00:40:43.170 --> 00:40:45.670
I'm the jerk here, thinking things are going to be different.

00:40:48.340 --> 00:40:50.750
This isn't your fault, Griffin.

00:40:52.840 --> 00:40:58.260
I had this friend on the ship.

00:40:59.410 --> 00:40:59.950
His name is...

00:41:00.670 --> 00:41:12.840
Ziggy like the cartoon character had this big round head. So we call them anyway one day. We're having a beer

00:41:12.840 --> 00:41:16.510
You know, we'd been out there for a couple of months and zig says

00:41:17.740 --> 00:41:28.980
So how long's your old man been dead? So he's not what are you talking about? Couldn't believe he says

00:41:31.340 --> 00:41:36.010
He says, we work every day together, eat every meal.

00:41:36.130 --> 00:41:42.230
We live in this two-by-nothing room, and you've never said one word about it.

00:41:46.340 --> 00:41:59.970
He just assumed that I'm scared of forgetting.

00:42:00.000 --> 00:42:07.380
Because you talk about your mom and dad so much.

00:42:09.300 --> 00:42:13.280
It's like they're so in your life.

00:42:17.090 --> 00:42:18.990
Sometimes I have to remind myself how come I've never met.

00:42:30.160 --> 00:42:33.580
I'm going to spoil my kids so bad.
